{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/2847","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/2847/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/2847/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/2847/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/2847","id":3364335146,"node_id":"I_kwDOOYsS4c7Ih64q","number":2847,"title":"A way to exclude sensitive files","user":{"login":"mkusaka","id":24956031,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTU2MDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24956031?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka","html_url":"https://github.com/mkusaka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkusaka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8448146923,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOYsS4c8AAAAB94x96w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"},{"id":9225645138,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOYsS4c8AAAACJeQsUg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/labels/sandbox","name":"sandbox","color":"c56e3e","default":false,"description":"Issues related to permissions or sandboxing"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":92,"created_at":"2025-08-28T18:48:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T11:15:34Z","closed_at":"2026-06-29T18:12:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What feature would you like to see?\n\n- A mechanism to explicitly mark files/paths that the agent must not read or send to the model, at both repository and global levels (e.g., a repo-local .codexignore plus a global ignore file).\n- Example: keep node_modules/ searchable for implementation checks, but never read or send .env, .env.*, *.pem, id_*, .aws/**, .ssh/**.\n- The configuration should be deterministic and shareable across the team/repo, and also support user defaults, rather than relying on project documentation or conventions.\n\n### Are you interested in implementing this feature?\n\n- Yes — I can contribute and tests.\n\n\n### Additional information\n\nRelated: #205. That issue surfaced two primary use cases: preventing sensitive data from being sent to the model and excluding large/irrelevant files. The issue was closed in favor of a Rust (codex-rs) implementation, but as of 2025-08-28 a comparable feature does not appear to exist in codex-rs. I’d like to restart the discussion and converge on a design.\n","closed_by":{"login":"etraut-openai","id":223546144,"node_id":"U_kgDODVMLIA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223546144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai","html_url":"https://github.com/etraut-openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etraut-openai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/2847/reactions","total_count":462,"+1":462,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/2847/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}